# 🏋️ Liftoff Clone — Gamified Workout Tracker

Built for [8x Engineer Workout Tracker Contest](https://8xengineer.com/contests/workout-tracker-gym-log).

Track workouts, crush PRs, dominate leaderboards.

Built using [8x Engineer Mobile Template](https://github.com/8xsocial/template-mobile.git) ⭐

## 🚀 Run Instantly (**No Setup Required**)

The application comes pre-configured with a mock repository implementation and curated JSON exercise data, meaning you can test it immediately without needing to provide an API key or configure Firebase.

```bash
# Web preview with mock data (fastest way to demo)
flutter run -d chrome

# iOS/Android with mock data
flutter run
```

## 🌟 Features Showcase

- ✅ Custom routine builder with 60+ exercises covering all muscle groups.
- ✅ Swipe-to-complete set logger with integrated haptic feedback.
- ✅ Auto-start 90s rest timer overlay.
- ✅ PR celebration with confetti animation and distinct vibration bursts.
- ✅ Strength progression charts (Estimated 1RM line charts and Volume Heatmaps).
- ✅ Real-time styled leaderboard (Weekly/Monthly rankings, glowing cards for user rank, top 3 coloring).

## 🏗️ Architecture Highlights

- **Repository Pattern**: Strict separation of concerns via abstract classes. Easy to swap between the included Mock implementations and the included Firebase implementations.
- **State Management**: Built using modern **Riverpod 2.x** (`NotifierProvider`, `FutureProvider`, and `StreamProvider` for realtime UI updates).
- **Theming**: Deep Purple & Teal Material Design 3 Dark Theme.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Flutter / Dart** (Cross-platform UI)
- **flutter_riverpod** (State management)
- **fl_chart** (Data visualization)
- **Firebase SDKs** (`firebase_core`, `cloud_firestore`, `firebase_auth`)
- **vibration** & **confetti** (Haptics and micro-interactions)

## 🔥 Enable Live Backend (Optional)

If you'd like to test the live leaderboard via Firebase, see [README_FIREBASE_SETUP.md](README_FIREBASE_SETUP.md) for step-by-step configuration instructions.
